+- leave their existing single-item behavior unchanged
+- do NOT change the backend
+- do NOT manufacture fake lists
+- mention this limitation in your summary
+
+If they are already lists:
+apply the same 5-visible-item scrolling behavior to them.
+
+IMPORTANT CONSTRAINTS
+
+Do NOT:
+- redesign the dashboard
+- change unrelated components
+- modify other pages
